Folder structure in the robot framework
--> Library : Used for storing custom library.
--> Resources : Writing reusable code and to maintain the page objects.
--> Results : Where we can store the all the Results.
--> Tests : To maintain test cases in that folder.


File structure
--> Settings : Documentation, Library
--> Variables : Variables which are required for the test
--> Testcases : All Testcases
--> Keywords : Keywords required for the Testcases





Commands:
python -m robot -d Results Tests --> To run robot testcases
python -m robot -d Results .\Tests\iframe.robot --> To run a specific file


